{"suttaId":"tha-ap405","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[13032,13111],"vripara":"45"},"segments":{"tha-ap405:0.3":"Mettaguttheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap405:1.1":"“Himavantassāvidūre,","tha-ap405:1.2":"asoko nāma pabbato;","tha-ap405:1.3":"Tatthāsi assamo mayhaṃ,","tha-ap405:1.4":"vissakammena [visukammena (sī. syā. ka.)] māpito. 46.","tha-ap405:2.1":"“Sumedho nāma sambuddho,","tha-ap405:2.2":"aggo kāruṇiko muni;","tha-ap405:2.3":"Nivāsayitvā pubbaṇhe,","tha-ap405:2.4":"piṇḍāya me [maṃ (sī.)] upāgami. 47.","tha-ap405:3.1":"“Upāgataṃ mahāvīraṃ,","tha-ap405:3.2":"sumedhaṃ lokanāyakaṃ;","tha-ap405:3.3":"Paggayha sugatapattaṃ [sugataṃ pattaṃ (sī.), subhakaṃ pattaṃ (pī.)],","tha-ap405:3.4":"sappitelaṃ apūrayiṃ [sappitelena pūrayiṃ (sī.), sappitelassa’pūrayiṃ (?)]. 48.","tha-ap405:4.1":"“Datvānahaṃ buddhaseṭṭhe,","tha-ap405:4.2":"sumedhe lokanāyake;","tha-ap405:4.3":"Añjaliṃ paggahetvāna,","tha-ap405:4.4":"bhiyyo [bhīyo (sī.), bhīyyo (pī.)] hāsaṃ janesahaṃ. 49.","tha-ap405:5.1":"“Iminā sappidānena,","tha-ap405:5.2":"cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","tha-ap405:5.3":"Devabhūto manusso vā,","tha-ap405:5.4":"labhāmi vipulaṃ sukhaṃ. 50.","tha-ap405:6.1":"“Vinipātaṃ vivajjetvā,","tha-ap405:6.2":"saṃsarāmi bhavābhave;","tha-ap405:6.3":"Tattha cittaṃ paṇidhitvā,","tha-ap405:6.4":"labhāmi acalaṃ padaṃ. 51.","tha-ap405:7.1":"“Lābhā tuyhaṃ suladdhaṃ te,","tha-ap405:7.2":"yaṃ maṃ addakkhi brāhmaṇa;","tha-ap405:7.3":"Mama dassanamāgamma,","tha-ap405:7.4":"arahattaṃ bhavissati [arahā tvaṃ bhavissasi (sī. pī.), arahattaṃ gamissasi (syā.)]. 52.","tha-ap405:8.1":"“Vissattho [vissaṭṭho (syā. pī.), visaṭṭho (ka.)] hohi mā bhāyi,","tha-ap405:8.2":"adhigantvā mahāyasaṃ;","tha-ap405:8.3":"Mamañhi sappiṃ datvāna,","tha-ap405:8.4":"parimokkhasi jātiyā. 53.","tha-ap405:9.1":"“Iminā sappidānena,","tha-ap405:9.2":"cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","tha-ap405:9.3":"Devabhūto manusso vā,","tha-ap405:9.4":"labhase vipulaṃ sukhaṃ. 54.","tha-ap405:10.1":"“Iminā sappidānena,","tha-ap405:10.2":"mettacittavatāya ca;","tha-ap405:10.3":"Aṭṭhārase kappasate,","tha-ap405:10.4":"devaloke ramissasi. 55.","tha-ap405:11.1":"“Aṭṭhatiṃsatikkhattuñca,","tha-ap405:11.2":"devarājā bhavissasi;","tha-ap405:11.3":"Padesarajjaṃ vipulaṃ,","tha-ap405:11.4":"gaṇanāto asaṅkhiyaṃ. 56.","tha-ap405:12.1":"“Ekapaññāsakkhattuñca,","tha-ap405:12.2":"cakkavattī bhavissasi;","tha-ap405:12.3":"Cāturanto vijitāvī,","tha-ap405:12.4":"jambumaṇḍassa [jambusaṇḍassa (sī. pī.)] issaro. 57.","tha-ap405:13.1":"“Mahāsamuddovakkhobho,","tha-ap405:13.2":"duddharo pathavī yathā;","tha-ap405:13.3":"Evameva ca te bhogā,","tha-ap405:13.4":"appameyyā bhavissare. 58.","tha-ap405:14.1":"“Saṭṭhikoṭī hiraññassa,","tha-ap405:14.2":"cajitvā [catvāna (sī. ka.), datvāna (syā. pī.)] pabbajiṃ ahaṃ;","tha-ap405:14.3":"Kiṃ kusalaṃ gavesanto,","tha-ap405:14.4":"bāvariṃ upasaṅkamiṃ. 59.","tha-ap405:15.1":"“Tattha mante adhīyāmi,","tha-ap405:15.2":"chaḷaṅgaṃ nāma lakkhaṇaṃ;","tha-ap405:15.3":"Tamandhakāraṃ vidhamaṃ,","tha-ap405:15.4":"uppajji tvaṃ mahāmuni. 60.","tha-ap405:16.1":"“Tava dassanakāmohaṃ,","tha-ap405:16.2":"āgatomhi mahāmuni;","tha-ap405:16.3":"Tava dhammaṃ suṇitvāna,","tha-ap405:16.4":"pattomhi acalaṃ padaṃ. 61.","tha-ap405:17.1":"“Tiṃsakappasahassamhi,","tha-ap405:17.2":"sappiṃ buddhassadāsahaṃ;","tha-ap405:17.3":"Etthantare nābhijāne,","tha-ap405:17.4":"sappiṃ viññāpitaṃ [viññāpitā (?)] mayā. 62.","tha-ap405:18.1":"“Mama saṅkappamaññāya,","tha-ap405:18.2":"uppajjati yadicchakaṃ;","tha-ap405:18.3":"Cittamaññāya nibbattaṃ,","tha-ap405:18.4":"sabbe santappayāmahaṃ. 63.","tha-ap405:19.1":"“Aho buddhā aho dhammā [aho buddho aho dhammo (sī.) theragā. 201 theragāthāya tadaṭṭhakathāya ca saṃsandetabbaṃ],","tha-ap405:19.2":"aho no satthu sampadā;","tha-ap405:19.3":"Thokañhi sappiṃ datvāna,","tha-ap405:19.4":"appameyyaṃ labhāmahaṃ. 64.","tha-ap405:20.1":"“Mahāsamudde udakaṃ,","tha-ap405:20.2":"yāvatā nerupassato;","tha-ap405:20.3":"Mama sappiṃ upādāya,","tha-ap405:20.4":"kalabhāgaṃ na hessati [hissati (syā. ka.), essati (sī.)]. 65.","tha-ap405:21.1":"“Yāvatā cakkavāḷassa,","tha-ap405:21.2":"kariyantassa [kārayantassa (syā.), kayirantassa (pī.), āharantassa (ka.)] rāsito;","tha-ap405:21.3":"Mama nibbattavatthānaṃ [mayā nivatthavatthānaṃ (pī.)],","tha-ap405:21.4":"okāso so na sammati. 66.","tha-ap405:22.1":"“Pabbatarājā himavā,","tha-ap405:22.2":"pavaropi siluccayo;","tha-ap405:22.3":"Mamānulittagandhassa,","tha-ap405:22.4":"upanidhiṃ [upanidhaṃ (sī. syā. ka.), upanīyaṃ (pī.)] na hessati. 67.","tha-ap405:23.1":"“Vatthaṃ gandhañca sappiñca,","tha-ap405:23.2":"aññañca diṭṭhadhammikaṃ;","tha-ap405:23.3":"Asaṅkhatañca nibbānaṃ,","tha-ap405:23.4":"sappidānassidaṃ phalaṃ. 68.","tha-ap405:24.1":"“Satipaṭṭhānasayano,","tha-ap405:24.2":"samādhijhānagocaro;","tha-ap405:24.3":"Bojjhaṅgabhojano [… janano (syā. ka.)] ajja,","tha-ap405:24.4":"sappidānassidaṃ phalaṃ. 69.","tha-ap405:25.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ…pe…","tha-ap405:25.3":"viharāmi anāsavo. 70.","tha-ap405:26.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi…pe…","tha-ap405:26.3":"kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ. 71.","tha-ap405:27.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso…pe…","tha-ap405:27.3":"kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap405:28.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā mettagū thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap405:29.1":"Mettaguttherassāpadānaṃ tatiyaṃ. 4."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":3321,"to":3321,"paras":[{"para":3321,"vripara":"45","refs":["tha-ap405:1"],"lines":["Tatiyāpadāne <b>himavantassāvidūre</b>tiādikaṃ āyasmato mettaguttherassa apadānaṃ.","Tattha himavantasamīpe asokapabbate so tāpaso hutvā paṇṇasālāyaṃ vasanto sumedhasambuddhaṃ disvā pattaṃ gahetvā sappipūraṇaṃ viseso.","Sesaṃ puññaphalāni ca suviññeyyāneva.","Apadānagāthānaṃ attho ca pākaṭoyeva. 72."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap405:1"],["tha-ap405:1"],["tha-ap405:1"],["tha-ap405:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap405:1.1","himavantassāvidūre",0,0]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
